(text "Notes" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 662.94 176.022 0) (effects (font (size 2 2) (thickness 0.4) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "c599d533-1dad-479c-b379-746a7332d913"))
(text "Bank TPS48100 VBAT_P -> VBAT_SLOTS: 5 mOhm + 61.9k = SCP 21.2/28.6/36.3 A, 68\nnF + 100k latch-off 517-1490 us (5.0x the slot timer). Hardware overload\ncutoff: INA281A2 -> 15.8k / 2x 10 uF -> TLV3012B -> 74LVC1G74 latch -> AO3400A\npulls U110 UVLO low; trip 3.15-3.76 A HOT (default, tau 316 ms) or 5.11-6.08 A\nROOM (TS5A3166 adds 25.5k, 0x22 P13, tau 195 ms); clear by toggling BANK_EN.\nEach slot: TPS48100 + 2x BSC070N10NS5 + 5 mOhm + 24.3k = SCP 10.6/13.5/16.6 A,\n4.7 nF + 100k latch-off 36-103 us. Gate network (bank + 8 slots): 470R G1PU;\n2.2 nF C1 diode-steered (1N4148W + 10R, 1M bleed to SRC); 1N4148W gate -> BST\nclamp; BZT52C15 G-S; C_BST 1 uF / 50 V. Peak Vgs 14.8 V worst when SRC\ncollapses; BST-SRC >= 9.01 V at turn-on.\nUVLO nodes 4.7 nF (tau 100 us): supply dips cannot drop a channel before its\nSCP latches. 100 nF / 100 V on VBAT_SLOTS at U110 SRC and every slot VS, and\non every SLn_VBAT. TPS2553 210k (+3V3 main, 110-150 mA), FAULT wired-OR with\nFLT onto SLn_PWR_FAULT_N.\nPWR_EN = NOT EN_N AND NOT PRESENT_N (1G02); OUT_EN_N = NAND(PWR_EN,\nGLOBAL_OUT_ALLOW, NOT ARM_N) (1G04 + 1G10). +3V3_ID via 68R 1206. Math:\nMODULAR_ARCHITECTURE sections 14-15, docs/modular/pass3_calc.txt." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 664.21 180.34 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "20bee5d7-7855-4eea-aabc-82dba70fadda"))
(embedded_fonts no))
